dIn Partnership Announcement**: Geodd announced bringing models like GLM 5.2 and DeepSeek v4 Flash to the EU-centric model gateway\n4. **AIDiveForge Listing**: Audited and listed on July 9, 2026\n\n## **Industry Context:**\n\nA Forbes article from July 5, 2026 discusses agent gateways becoming \"the control plane for enterprise AI,\" noting that this category is consolidating, with other players like Portkey (acquired by Palo Alto) and Solo.io contributing agent gateway technology to the Linux Foundation.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."
